@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
hide footbox
actor "Gudang / Admin" as P0
participant "Form PO" as P1
participant "Express API" as P2
participant "Firestore Admin" as P3
P0 -> P1: Isi vendor dan barang
P1 -> P1: Hitung total dan validasi
P0 -> P1: Kirim pengajuan PO
P1 -> P2: POST /api/purchase-orders
P2 -> P2: Verifikasi token dan role
P2 -> P2: Validasi nilai serta item
P2 -> P3: Transaksi baca ID PO
P3 --> P2: PO belum ada / retry sama
P2 -> P3: Create PO Pending Approval
P3 --> P2: Commit berhasil
P2 --> P1: 201 dan PO tersimpan
P1 --> P0: Konfirmasi pengajuan
@enduml